<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">MFS- OMUSEBEZI NO KUTOLOKA EBIBELE NO SILUYANA</book>
  <para style="h">Maefese</para>
  <para style="toc1">Elin̄olo lya Paulusi ku Maefese</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maefese</para>
  <para style="toc3">Efe</para>
  <para style="mt2">Elin̄olo lya Paulusi ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">MAEFESE</para>
  <para style="imt">Okulimukisa</para>
  <para style="ip">Elin̄olo ku Maefese kame lina ku n̄oliwa mu nako imweya kanyi elin̄olo no Makolose emyaka makumi atanu ni likumi limweya (60) munyima no kuleiwa kwa Kilesite. Osikun̄ola kame akulimukisa yonyene nji ni mutumiwa Paulusi (1.1). Asi kukwiyeta nonyene kame apumena nji, niti luli ni yonyene simba nji mu lin̄olo kakwisa okukeeta kanyi oko kuwaniwa mu lin̄olo no Makolose. Mwendi elibaka elyo ina kutendelwa ni ku hasanyiwa mu tikeleke no kupula mu tolopo. Paulusi kame aamba kame nji, kame ana kunungiwa mu tolongo aba ana kun̄ola elin̄olo eli, (3.1; 4.1; and 6.20). Paulusi na kutuma elin̄olo ni Tacikasi mu mwendo waye okapotela ekeleke mu Efese (6.21-22).</para>
  <para style="ip">Efese neli omulenen̄i no kuneneba onene mane neli omutwi no mulenen̄i no Maloma mu Asiya. Efese kame ina kulimukiwa onene ku Tempele yayo eyo ina kubekiwa mu makaa no milimu no Magelike (Tikezo19.23-31). Ekeleke na mu Efese kame ina kongolanga ku matatekelo kono munyima kame ina kumonahala okushekesha (Sinulo 2.1-7).</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulusi kame atoloka mu licika no matatekelo no lin̄olo eli, Nyambe omo ana ketele aanu aye mane nakwa yoyisa kuuyi woo mwa Jesu Kilesite. Kame abapanya ekeleke ku lutu ni Kilesite nji Omutwi ni muyako ni Kilesite nji yo liwee linene no lilulu. Mu licika no wiili Paulusi kame aba etitaelo omo afanena okuyoyela asikupumena.</para>
  <para style="iot">Emitwi no Titaba</para>
  <para style="io">1. Mu kauhanyo no 1.1-2 Paulusi kame akulimukisa yonyene mane ni kukeeta Amaefese.</para>
  <para style="io2">Cwale sebeli otoloka oumweya no Keleke ni Kilesite (1.2-3; 21).</para>
  <para style="io3">Cwale Paulusi kame an̄ola omukwa omo afanena okuyoyela asikupumena 4.1-6; 20).</para>
  <para style="io4">Ku mamaneneno Paulusi kame aba amaywi no kuyatila (6.21-24).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1"/>Okutunda kwa Paulusi omutumiwa wa Jesu Kilesite muku singa kwa Nyambe,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Kwa asikupumena awo asepahala mwa Kilesite Jesu. <verse eid="EPH 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2"/>Esishemo ni kozo ikale kwaanyi okutunda kwa Nyambe Sitetu ni Mbumu Jesu Kilesite.<verse eid="EPH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etimbuyoti no Mebo mwa Kilesite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3"/>Etumbo iikale kwa Nyambe ni Sitaye Mbumu wetu Jesu Kilesite! Woyo onatu fuyola mwa Kilesite ni timbuyoti no mebo mu kozo mu ibaka naku wilu. <verse eid="EPH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4"/>Simba abana kutuketa mwa yonyene eliwilu ekalya sisumiwa kale, nji kame tufanena okukena ni kuulwa okunyazahala balubala lwaye. <verse eid="EPH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5"/>Nakutu keta mu lilato nji tutende anaye mulibaka lya Jesu Kilesite okukumanena mu kusinga kwaye. <verse eid="EPH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6"/>Okulumbeka ekanya no sishemo saye eso ana kutuba feela mwa mwanaye osingiwa. <verse eid="EPH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7"/>Mwa yonyene natu liululwa mu unyinga waye, okulemeniwa ku mibonda yetu, okukumanena ku ufumu no sishemo saye, <verse eid="EPH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8"/>eso ana kutuba mu kupula. <verse eid="EPH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9"/>Kakuli kame ana kutu limukisa mu kushangama ni kumona eyi ishweekilwe mu kusinga kwaye, okukumanena ku kutenda kwaye eyo ana kulukisa okutundelela mwa Kilesite. <verse eid="EPH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10"/>Mu mulelo no kwiyateteta enako okuwaneka bamweya einu yonje mwa yonyene, einu namu wilu ni inu na ba litunga. <verse eid="EPH 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11"/>Mwa yonyene okukumanena ni mulelo waye woyo omanenena einu yonje okukumanena ni kusinga kwaye. <verse eid="EPH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12"/>Aci no weli okusepa mwa Kilesite natu bekiwa ni kuketiwa okuyoya mulibaka no kulumbeka ekanya yaye. <verse eid="EPH 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13"/>Mwa yonyene naanyi ngeso awo ana yupu eliywi no niti, eliywi no kuyoyisiwa kwenu ni kupumena mwa yonyene namu kubeekiwa enombolo no Emebo No Kukena muna kusepisiwa. <verse eid="EPH 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14"/>Emebo no Kukena neli sepiso no kuyola kwetu okutwala abo satubiwe esanda mu tumbo no kanya yaye.<verse eid="EPH 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etapelo ya Paulusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15"/>Mulibaka eli kakuli kame nina yupu eyi no tumelo yenu mwa Jesu Ombumu ni lilato lyenu kwa aanu a Nyambe no kukena onje, <verse eid="EPH 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16"/>Kani twese okulesela okumiba etumbo niku miyambuta mu milapelo yange, <verse eid="EPH 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17"/>nji Nyambe no Mbumu wetu Jesu Kilesite Sitaye kanya, amibe Emebo no kushangama neyi no sinulo nji cwale mu mulimuke. <verse eid="EPH 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18"/>Cwale kame ni lapela nji amiyo no micima yenu ayatuluke nji mulimuke esepo eyo ana kumi isanena, kasifumu eso satu kawane mu sanda no kanya yaye mwa anu a Nyambe no kukena, <verse eid="EPH 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19"/>cwale ngasibine kuwabile ni kuneneba no maata aye mwaaci anu no kukena a Nyambe, okukumanena ku kusebeza kwaye no kuneneba luli, <verse eid="EPH 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20"/>oko ana kumanenena mwa Kilesite abana kumwingula kwaafu ni kwikala ku lyoko lyaye no silyo mu ibaka na mu wilu. <verse eid="EPH 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21"/>Beulu no kubusa konje ni tukelo mane ni maata ni puso, ni beulu no litina lyonje elyo litumbilwe kasa muno mu nako feela kono ni mu nako ikeyile. <verse eid="EPH 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22"/>Cwale Nyambe nabeeke einu yonje munji no makondo aye mane naku mutenda omutwi kwiinu yonje eyi no keleke, <verse eid="EPH 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23"/>eyo olutu lwaye, okwiyatetetwa kwaye woyo oiyata einu yonje mu ibaka yonje.<verse eid="EPH 1:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Okutunda ku Lufu okuta ku Moyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1"/>Cwale anyi ana kutenda awo no kuyoya, abo muna kufa mweyo no mibonda ni ibi. <verse eid="EPH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2"/>Omo muna kwendelanga, okukon̄a emiyoyelo no litunga lino, okukon̄a ombumu no maata no mebo, emebo eyo isebeza bano mwaana no kwa kuteka Nyambe. <verse eid="EPH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3"/>Mukaci no eyi, naaci kunyima natu kuyoyanga mu mwikalelo no lutu lwetu, okukon̄a etitakazo no lutu ni minahano mi cwale kame tuna kutenda aana no kutweba mu kuyoya kanyi omuyoyelo no aanu onje.<verse eid="EPH 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4"/>Kono Nyambe woyo ofumine mu makeke, okutunda mu lilato linene elyo ana kutu singa, <verse eid="EPH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5"/>simba nji kame tuna kufa mu mibonda yetu, nakutu yoyisa bamweya ni Kilesite. Mulibaka no sishemo sa Nyambe namu yoyisiwa. <verse eid="EPH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6"/>Cwale naku twingula naye mane ni kwikala naye mu ibaka na kuwilu mwa Kilesite Jesu. <verse eid="EPH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7"/>Nji cwale mu tinako tikeyile mbafanene okumonisa oufumu no sishemo saye no kwapimiwa mu musa kwaci mwa Kilesite Jesu. <verse eid="EPH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8"/>Kakuli mulibaka no sishemo namu yoyisiwa mulibaka no tumelo, mi kasa mulibaka no misebezi yenu mwenyene, eyi nimpo itunda kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="EPH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9"/>Kasa mulibaka no misebezi yenu, nji cwale omunu yonje akuyeeme. <verse eid="EPH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10"/>Kakuli kame tuli eyumbiwa ya Nyambe no utokwa, mu kuumbiwa mwa Kilesite Jesu ku misebezi no kuwaba, eyo ana kulukisa Nyambe oweli nji tufanene okwendamo.<verse eid="EPH 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Oumweya mwa Kilesite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11"/>Cwalehe mupuluke nji mu nako injili anyi asimacaba mukuleiwa mu lutu, aisaniwa nji “Anokwata ku mupato” kwawo aisaniwa nji, “Asikuta ku mupato” owo ona kutendiwa mu lutu ni maoko. <verse eid="EPH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12"/>Mupuluke nji mu nako ica kame muna kutundisiwa kwa Kilesite. Kame muna kutenda angenda ku Maisilaele ni ku ulikani no sepiso me muulwile esepo ni kuulwa Nyambe mu litunga. <verse eid="EPH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13"/>Kono bano mwa Kilesite Jesu anyi muna kwikalanga okuno kuleba, namu litiwa beebi mu unyinga wa Kilesite. <verse eid="EPH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14"/>Kakuli Kilesite ya kozo yetu, woyo ona kututenda mumweya tonje mi natibula elimota no ukutaba no kwakuyupa. <verse eid="EPH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15"/>Mu kumana omulawo no Majuda ni lutu lwaye mane ni titaelo nji cwale mwa yonyene, aumbu omunu mumweya no ubya mu sibaka no anu ayiili nji alite ekozo, <verse eid="EPH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16"/>nji cwale atu usete kwa Nyambe mu lutu lumweya mulibaka no sifapano ni kumana olutimbo. <verse eid="EPH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17"/>Cwale kame ana kwiiya mukukutaza ekozo kwaanyi muna kwikala oko no kuleba ni kwaawo ana kwikala abeebi. <verse eid="EPH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18"/>Kakuli mulibaka lyaye kame tuli ni tukelo mu Mebo imweya kwa Sitetu.<verse eid="EPH 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19"/>Cwale kasa muli angenda kame simba awo atunda kundina, kono sebeli muli asinaha imweya naanu a Nyambe no kukena naanu asindoo ya Nyambe. <verse eid="EPH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20"/>Mukuyakiwa ba mutomo no atumiwa nanuhi, Kilesite Jesu yokame eliwee no utokwa. <verse eid="EPH 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21"/>Mwa yonyene endoo kame iwanekilwe bamweya ni kukula mu ndoo no kukena ya Nyambe mwa Mbumu. <verse eid="EPH 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22"/>Mwa yonyene naanyi ngeso kame muyakilwemo nji mwikalemo kakuli esibaka no kwikala sa Nyambe mu Mebo.<verse eid="EPH 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3"/>
  <para style="s">Omusebezi wa Paulusi kwa Simacaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1"/>Mulibaka eli, mene Paulusi, omunungiwa wa Kilesite Jesu okwimanena anyi Asimacaba. <verse eid="EPH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2"/>Luli namu yupu eyi no musebezi no sishemo sa Nyambe eso sina kubiwa kwa mene mulibaka lyenu. <verse eid="EPH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3"/>Omo tina kumonisetwa etikunutu kwa mene mu sinulo kanyi omo nina in̄olele mu kwiibiba, <verse eid="EPH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4"/>aba mubala eyi, mbamu monisisa omo niyupisiseta eyi no kunutu ya Kilesite, <verse eid="EPH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5"/>eyo ina kushwekeliwa kwaana no aanu mu masika anjili kanyi aba ina kumonahaza bano kwa tumiwa aye no kukena ni kwa nuhi a Nyambe mu mebo. <verse eid="EPH 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6"/>Elibaka elyo omo asimacaba sebeli ali ayooli, asilutu lumweya, sebeli ali ni tukelo ku tisepiso taye ana kuba mwa Kilesite Jesu mulibaka no liywi no kuwaba.<verse eid="EPH 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7"/>Mulibaka no liywi no kuwaba eli kame nina kutendiwa omubeleki okukumanena ku mpo no sishemo sa Nyambe, eyo nina kubiwa mu maata aye awo abeleka. <verse eid="EPH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8"/>Kwa mene simba nji kame nili woyo no mamaneneno kwaanu onje no kukena a Nyambe, esishemo esi nasi kubiwa kwa mene okukutaza kwa asimacaba oufumu wa Kilesite no kwa saeliwa, <verse eid="EPH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9"/>mi ni kumonisa aanu onje nji omulelo no kunutu ina kushwekelwa ana kukale mwa Nyambe woyo ona kuumba einu yonje, <verse eid="EPH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10"/>nji mulibaka no keleke okupula no kushangama kwa Nyambe, kufanene okulimukiwa bano kwawo ali ni tukelo ni maata mu ibaka na kuwilu. <verse eid="EPH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11"/>Eyi neli okukumanena ni mulelo waye no kwaabwa, owo ana kulemuha mwa Kilesite Jesu Ombumu wetu. <verse eid="EPH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12"/>Mwa yonyene omo tuna wana okongola ni kusepa okusheeteta kwa yonyene mulibaka no tumelo yetu mwa yonyene. <verse eid="EPH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13"/>Cwale kame nimi kumbela nji mulese okuzwafa aba niyanda mulibaka lyenu, eyo ili ekanya yenu.<verse eid="EPH 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Elilato lya Kilesite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14"/>Mulibaka eli kame nikubama banji ni manwi balubala lwa Sitange, <verse eid="EPH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15"/>okutunda kwa yonyene amasika onje mu wilu ni ba litunga na mutumbiwa amatina no niti, <verse eid="EPH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16"/>okukumanena ni ufumu no kanya yaye mba mibi amaata mutende ano kongola mulibaka no Mebo ku munu namu kaci, <verse eid="EPH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17"/>nji cwale Jesu ayoye mu micima yenu mulibaka no tumelo, nji anyi mwikale ni mibisi mi musumiwe mu lilato, <verse eid="EPH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18"/>nji cwale anyi bamweya ni aanu no kukena a Nyambe onje muyupisise okwibiba ni mukuleba ni mukutunga ni kuneneba <verse eid="EPH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19"/>ni kulimuka elilato lya Kilesite elyo libitelela etingana, nji cwale mwiyale ni mwiyalelela onje wa Nyambe.<verse eid="EPH 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20"/>Cwale kwa yonyene woyo mulibaka no maata awo abeleka mwaaci, kame atwesa okutenda eyi no kupula onene okubita eyo tukumbela neyo tu nahana, <verse eid="EPH 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21"/>kwa Nyambe kwikale ekanya mu keleke ni mwa Kilesite Jesu mu nako yonje, oko no kwaabwa! Ameni.<verse eid="EPH 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4"/>
  <para style="s">Oukuyupa no lutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1"/>Cwalehe mene, osikunungiwa mulibaka lya Mbumu kame ni mikumbela okuyoya omooyo ofanena okwisanwa oko munaisaniwa. <verse eid="EPH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2"/>Mu ukukokobeza konje, okuluka ni mu kutatelela. Mu kubabalele omunjili ni munjili mu lilato. <verse eid="EPH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3"/>Weteke omo otweseta monje okubukeleza oukuyupa no Mebo mu ukununga no kozo. <verse eid="EPH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4"/>Kame kuli olutu lumweya ni Mebo imweya, kanyi aba muna kwisaniwa mu sepo imweya eyo ili mu kwisaniwa kwenu. <verse eid="EPH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5"/>Kame kuli feela ni Mbumu mumweya, etumelo imweya mane ni kolobezo imweya, <verse eid="EPH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6"/>kame tuli ni Nyambe mumweya ni Sitetu tonje, woyo oli beulu no inu yonje, woyo osebeza mwaaci tonje mane ni kuyoya mwaaci tonje.<verse eid="EPH 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7"/>Kono esishemo nasi kubiwa ku munu ni munu kwaaci tonje okukumanena nomo atu bela Kilesite. <verse eid="EPH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8"/>Cwalehe kame yaamba mu man̄olo nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">“Aba ana nyuluhele ku liwilu kame ana lukulula ano kupula ali mu ukoba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">mi nakuba etimpo kwaanu.”<verse eid="EPH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9"/>Mu kwamba nji, “Na kambamene ku wilu” Iikene italusa kono kame nji na shetumukele ngeeso mu ibaka na kunji no litunga? <verse eid="EPH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10"/>Woyo ona kushetumukela banji yokame woyo ona kukambamena kule mu mawilu onje, nji cwale afanene okwiyateteta einu yonje. <verse eid="EPH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11"/>Cwale etimpo taye neli nji anjili atende atumiwa, anjili atende anuhi a Nyambe, anjili atende asikwambela emikopano, anjili atende alisana mane anjili atende aiyeti. <verse eid="EPH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12"/>Okulukisa aaanu a Nyambe no kukena mulibaka no musebezi no situlo, nji ayake wino olutu lwa Kilesite, <verse eid="EPH 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13"/>konji aci tonje aba satwiye mu ukulema kumweya oko no tumelo yetu noko no kulimuka Omwana a Nyambe, mbatutende aanu no kupetahala, okubita basiyemo no kwiyalelela sa Kilesite. <verse eid="EPH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14"/>Cwale tulese okutenda kanyi anuke, tulese okuyauluka ni mebo yonje no tuto, tulese okupumenena aanu no aongi nji atu onge ni mapwa oo. <verse eid="EPH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15"/>Simba okwamba eniti mu lilato, kame tukula mu mukwa onje mwa yonyene woyo oli omutwi mwa Kilesite. <verse eid="EPH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16"/>Okutunda mwa woyo olutu lonje nalu wanekiwa ni kunungiwa bamweya ku tingongo tonje omo lubeekelwe. Cwale esilama nji kame sibeleka wino kame sikulisa wino olutu nu ukuyaka sonyene mu lilato.<verse eid="EPH 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omooyo no Ubya mwa Kilesite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17"/>Cwale sino kame nongoteteta ni kwamba mwa Mbumu nji kamu fanene okuyoya kanyi omo atendela asimacaba mu minahano yoo no kufokola, <verse eid="EPH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18"/>kame ali mu uwi muku yupisisa koo. Kakuwanine ku mooyo wa Nyambe mulibaka no kwalimuka eso sili mwa onyene mulibaka no micima yoo no kongola. <verse eid="EPH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19"/>Kame anabwelwe amaikuto nuukuba onyene okuyoya mu uhule ni kutenda emikwa yonje no kwakena.<verse eid="EPH 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20"/>Kamu si kukwiyeta Kilesite ngeeso. <verse eid="EPH 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21"/>Mu kukulubelwa nji na mukuyupa eyaye mane naiiyetiwa mwa yonyene kanyi eniti ili mwa Jesu. <verse eid="EPH 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22"/>Cwale mutunde ku mikwa yenu no kale eyo ili ku mikwa no moyo wenu na kunyima mane kame isinyiwa mu mikwa no kwiiba. <verse eid="EPH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23"/>Cwale mushemunwe mu minahano yenu mu Mebo, <verse eid="EPH 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24"/>mi mukufuke omukwa no ubya ona umbiwa munyima no kufeka kwa Nyambe mu kuluka ni kukena no niti.<verse eid="EPH 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25"/>Cwalehe mutunde ku koonga mulesele omunu yonje aambe eniti ni mwabaye kakuli kame tuli aanu amweya ku munjili. <verse eid="EPH 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26"/>Mutine kono mulese okutenda esibi, mulese okutina nji mane eliywaa liike ositinine ngeso. <verse eid="EPH 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27"/>Cwale mulese okuba Diyabulosi esibaka. <verse eid="EPH 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28"/>Ombuyi alese okwiita, kono akutendele eyaye, okutenda emisebezi no kusepahala ni makaa aye, nji cwale atwese okuba kwawo kakwite. <verse eid="EPH 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29"/>Mu tunwa twenu mulese okwamba eyi no kwiiba, kono amaywi no kuwaba awo atusa, awo afanena nji abe esishemo kwawo amiyupa. <verse eid="EPH 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30"/>Cwale mulese okwenisa Emebo no Kukena ya Nyambe, mwa yonyene muna kubeekiwa enombolo mane konji ba liywaa no tiululo. <verse eid="EPH 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31"/>Mutundise eyi no kulula yonje, okutweba, okutina, okwaayuta mane ni lunya itunde kwaanyi mane ni matangu onje. <verse eid="EPH 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32"/>Cwale mukusinge omunjili ku munjili mulese oukutimba, mukulemene omunjili ku munjili kanyi Nyambe aba ana milemene mwa Kilesite.<verse eid="EPH 4:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5"/>
  <para style="s">Okuyoya mu liseli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1"/>Cwalehe mutende afaniketi a Nyambe, kanyi aana asingiwa. <verse eid="EPH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2"/>Mi mwende mu lilato, kanyi Kilesite omo ana kutusingela nuukuba yonyene mulibaka lyetu, okulita enubu no mumwee no kumamata ni sitabelo kwa Nyambe.<verse eid="EPH 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3"/>Kono owozwa ni inu yonje no kwiiba simba etitakazo kaifanene simba okwitoya amatina ayo mukaci kenu, kanyi omo kufanenena mukaci no aanu no kukena a Nyambe. <verse eid="EPH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4"/>Kusele okwikala eyi no kwenisa, neyi no weelo simba eyi ishekisa onene eyo no kwafanena, kono cwale muku tumele. <verse eid="EPH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5"/>Mulimuke nji kakwisa osikutenda owozwa, simba omunu no kwakena simba osititakazo (osikusebeleza emilimu) katamba okuyola mu mubuso wa Kilesite ni wa Nyambe.<verse eid="EPH 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6"/>Kulese okwikala omunu so myoonga ni maywi nambulwa tuso, kakuli ni mulibaka no inu eyi nji okutweba kwa Nyambe kame sakwiiye beulu no aana nambulwa elikute. <verse eid="EPH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7"/>Cwalehe mulese oukuwana noo. <verse eid="EPH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8"/>Kakuli kame muna kwikala mu uwi, kono bano kame muli mu liseli mwa Mbumu, mweende kanyi aana no liseli, <verse eid="EPH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9"/>kakuli embuya no liseli kame iwaniwa mu inu yonje no kuwaba ni kuluka mane ni niti. <verse eid="EPH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10"/>Cwale mweteke oukwiyeta eyo iwabelisa kwa Mbumu. <verse eid="EPH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11"/>Mulese okuwaniwa mu misebezi no uwi, kono cwale eyo mwinyaze. <verse eid="EPH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12"/>Kakuli kame kwenisa simba okwamba einu atenda mu kunutu. <verse eid="EPH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13"/>Kono cwale esinu nji kame sinyaziwa mulibaka no liseli kame simonahala, kakuli esinu sonje eso simonahala, eliseli. <verse eid="EPH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14"/>Cwalehe kame kwambiwa nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">“Mwinguke, anyi mulanganine,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">mi mwinguke kwaafu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">mi Kilesite mbamibi eliseli.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15"/>Mwalikete wino cwale omo mwendela, kasanji kanyi aano kwashangama kono ano kushangama. <verse eid="EPH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16"/>Mutende ngeso enako yonje kakuli aa nimaywaa no kwiiba. <verse eid="EPH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17"/>Cwalehe mulese okutenda aelo, kono muyupisise okusinga kwa Mbumu omo kwikalele.<verse eid="EPH 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18"/>Cwale mulese ku koliwa ku malopu, kakuli amalopu kame atwala kukutenda eyi no kwiiba, kono cwale mwiyale Emebo. <verse eid="EPH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19"/>Mu kwambote omunjili ni munjili mu Lisamu, mu tindimo, etindimo no mebo, okwiimba ni kutendela Ombumu etindimo no milumbeko ni micima yenu yonje. <verse eid="EPH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20"/>Enako yonje ni mwiinu yonje muku tumele mu litina lya Mbumu wetu Jesu Kilesite kwa Nyambe Sitetu.<verse eid="EPH 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Akati no Kukwaliwa na Lume noku Kwata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21"/>Mukubeeke omunjili ku munjili mulibaka no kucila Kilesite.<verse eid="EPH 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22"/>Akati no kukwaliwa mukubeeke kwa mbumwenu kanyi kwa Mbumu. <verse eid="EPH 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23"/>Kakuli omulume yo mutwi no moywaye kanyi Kilesite aba ali omutwi no keleke, olutu lwaye mi yokame luli Omuyoyisi wayo. <verse eid="EPH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24"/>Kanyi ekeleke omo ikubeekele kwa Kilesite, nakati no kukwaliwa akubeeke ngeso mu inu yonje kwa mbumoo.<verse eid="EPH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25"/>Alume no kukwata musinge amoywenu kanyi Kilesite omo ana kusingela ekeleke mane nuukuba yonyene kwa yonyene. <verse eid="EPH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26"/>Nji cwale aikenise okwiyowisa ni meyi mane ni liywi, <verse eid="EPH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27"/>nji cwale amonise ekeleke kwa yonyene mu kuwaba kwayo okuulwile esi sinyazahala simba etin̄onde simba esinu sonje, kame afanena okukena ni kwanyazahala. <verse eid="EPH 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28"/>Simba ngeeso alume kame afanena okusinga amoyo oo kanyi etinyutu too luli. Woyo osinga moywaye kame akusinga yonyene. <verse eid="EPH 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29"/>Kakuli kakwisa omunu woyo otimbile olutu lwaye, kono kame alufepa wino mane ni kulubabalela, kanyi Kilesite omo atendela ekeleke, <verse eid="EPH 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30"/>kakuli kame tuli eilama no lutu lwaye. <verse eid="EPH 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31"/>“Cwale mulibaka eli omulume mbasiyi Sitaye ni inawaye ni kwikala ni moywaye, mi ayiili mbatende olutu lumweya.” <verse eid="EPH 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32"/>Cwale etaba eyi inene eyi ikushweekile, kame naamba ngeso kakuli kame niifekisa kwa Kilesite ni keleke. <verse eid="EPH 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33"/>Mulibaka elyo cwale omulume yonje asinge moywaye kanyi omo akusingela yonyene, mane ni mukati no kukwaliwa amone nji kame akuteka mbumwaye.<verse eid="EPH 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6"/>
  <para style="s">Aana na Shemi oo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1"/>Aana, mukuteke ashemi enu mwa Mbumu, kakuli sokame esi silukeele. <verse eid="EPH 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2"/>“Okuteke sitowe ni inawowe” ou omulawo no weli ni sepiso, <verse eid="EPH 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3"/>“nji cwale einu iikale wino kwa wene mane nji oyoye enako no kuleba bano ba litunga.”<verse eid="EPH 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4"/>Ashemi mulese okwayuta anenu nji atine. Kono akulele mu likute mane ni milawo ya Mbumu.<verse eid="EPH 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Abika na Olyoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5"/>Abika mukuteke awo ali aolyenu na ba litunga mu kucila mane ni kunjanjata, ni mucima mumweya kanyi kwa Kilesite. <verse eid="EPH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6"/>Mutende ngeso kasa nji konji mumoniwe kwaanu, kono kanyi abika a Kilesite awo atenda eso asinga Nyambe okutundelela kunji no micima yenu. <verse eid="EPH 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7"/>Mutende emisebezi yenu mu kusinga wino kanyi kame musebeleza Mbumu kasa kanyi kwaanu feela. <verse eid="EPH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8"/>Mu kulimuka nji eso sonje atenda wino omunu mba tambula ngeso okutunda kwa Mbumu, simba nji mubika simba nji kasa mubika.<verse eid="EPH 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9"/>Ambumu mutende ngeso kwabika enu mi mulese okwa cilisa. Mukulimuka nji woyo oli mu wilu molyenu monje mi kakwite esaluluti.<verse eid="EPH 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Esilelezo yonje ya Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10"/>Kumamaneneno, mongole mwa Mbumu mane ni mu maata aye no kuneneba. <verse eid="EPH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11"/>Mukufuke eilwiso yonje ya Nyambe, nji cwale mutwese okukoma emikwa no Diyabulozi. <verse eid="EPH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12"/>Kakuli katulwisi olutu ni unyinga, kono kame tulwisa amaata no mbumu no litunga, kame tulwisa amaata, kame tulwisa abusisi no litunga no uwi uno mane ni kulwisa emebo no kwiiba mu ibaka naku wilu. <verse eid="EPH 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13"/>Cwalehe mushimbe eilwiso yonje ya Nyambe, nji mutwese okwimana mu maywaa no kwiiba mane aba samumane okutenda eyo yonje, mba mwimana.<verse eid="EPH 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14"/>Cwalehe mwimane, mu kununge amakanda okutendile eniti, me mukufukile esisilelezo basaali eso sitendile okuluka, <verse eid="EPH 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15"/>cwale mukumange ku makondo eilwiso no kwamba Eliywi no Kuwaba no kozo. <verse eid="EPH 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16"/>Kwiinu yonje, mushimbe etebe no tumelo eyo samu twese okutima amalimi onje a woyo no kwiiba. <verse eid="EPH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17"/>Mushimbe ekuwani no kuyoyisa ni mukwale no Mebo, eyo ili eliywi lya Nyambe. <verse eid="EPH 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18"/>Mulapele enako yonje mu Mebo, ni tapelo yonje nuukuba. Ku mamaneneno awo mutatelele mu kutundamena, mulapelele aanu onje no kukena a Nyambe. <verse eid="EPH 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19"/>Cwale ni mene muni lapelele nji nibiwe elin̄usa mekanicili okwamba eyo ishwekilwe no liywi no kuwaba. <verse eid="EPH 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20"/>Kakuli kame nili ondumeleti mu tolongo. Nji cwale naambe meni lukuluhile kanyi omo nisingela okwamba.<verse eid="EPH 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okukeeta no mamaneneno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21"/>Cwale bano mbamu limuka ngeso omo niikalele neyo nitenda, Taicikasi omusingiwa ni mwiyeti no kusepahala mwa Mbumu mba myambela einu yonje. <verse eid="EPH 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22"/>Kame nina mutumu kwaanyi mulibaka eli nji mulimuke omo twiikalele mane nji afanene okususuweza emicima yenu.<verse eid="EPH 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23"/>Ekozo iikale kwa singiwa ni lilato ni tumelo, okutunda kwa Nyambe Sitetu ni kwa Mbumu Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="EPH 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24"/>Esishemo siikale kwawo onje asinga Mbumu wetu Jesu Kilesite ni lilato no kwaafa.<verse eid="EPH 6:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6"/>
</usx>
